      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Up. I can't afford paying BRL 50 every month. Also, although i use a lot of the plus features i pay for, they're not worth the price if compared to other services: \n\n- Netflix never went more than BRL 30 (at least for me).\n\n- Discord Nitro's most expensive price is BRL 25, and although some blame it being expensive, I find it really fair. \n\n- Telegram Premium is localized almost the same numeric value for the price, USD 10 and BRL 10. \n\n- Steam has localized prices, although some still being expensive, but much more affordable than the direct conversion.\n\n- Rarely an online subscription service price here in Brazil is BRL 50 per month. They only do that if the company is small, or there are really a lot of benefits.\n\nEven if not doing a USD 10 to BRL 15, if it was BRL 25 it would be really, really more affordable :/ \n\nImportant to note also that using Meta's app marketplace is not the only way to manage a VRC+ subscription. Steam should also be noted.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
