  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can you do a conversion for us? I really want to subscribe to VRChat+, but 50 reais is too much.\n\nGuys, I'm Brazilian, and our minimum wage is 1,400 reais per month. Paying 10 dollars (which is about 50 reais) is REALLY hard for us. Just to give you an idea, 50 reais is approximately 4% of our salary, while 10 dollars of your wage is 0.8%. What you could do is a conversion like Amazon, discord and netflix did. Amazon, for exemple, they converted 15 dollars to 20 reais.",
